WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.721
Think of the dial like a gas pedal with a family safety latch.

2
00:00:04.721 --> 00:00:06.625
You can ease off anytime,

3
00:00:06.625 --> 00:00:10.280
but to guard against heat-of-the-moment choices,

4
00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:16.296
turning risk back upward requires a quick approval from your Head of Household.
